OL,3,GNEWSALife inside Russell Brand's
OL,4,ACategory C prison
OL,5,
OL,6,FConvicted rapist Russell Brand's move
OL,7,Fto a Category C prison has led to
OL,8,Fcriticism in recent days.
OL,10,FThe 51-year-old from Grays in Essex was
OL,11,Fmoved to HMP Littlehey, in rural
OL,12,FCambridgeshire, over the weekend.
OL,14,FHe spent the first days of his sentence
OL,15,Fof more than 10 years for one count of
OL,16,Frape and three of sexual assault at HMP
OL,17,FWandsworth, where a former prison
OL,18,Fgovernor says he would have been a
OL,19,F"drain on resources".
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
